{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28512","headline":"少年行 · 杜牧","name":"少年行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官爲骏马监，职帅羽林儿。\n两绶藏不见，落花何处期？\n猎敲白玉镫，怒袖紫金鎚。\n田窦长留醉，苏辛曲让岐。\n豪持出塞节，笑别远山眉。\n捷报云台贺，公卿拜寿巵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}